{"version":1,"content":"<p>Playground.ru報道稱，PS5和Xbox Series X|S玩家已經在玩《GTA6》玩得熱火朝天，PC玩家卻出乎意料地淡定，而Charlie Intel在社交平台X上發起的投票顯示，近半數投票者對等待PC版並不特別着急，或對Rockstar Games的這款新作完全不感興趣。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1588068.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:04:28.700188+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:39:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:35.895469+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:35.895469+00:00","content_hash":"1c181f1f2efcb9d98ac6bfa733695dd9eed04946cd55b5f2b875e166c05a5bf1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}